# POS · Track A canary · Fault-catch · single-arm handler `catch Fault.Overflow:
# -1` · binding `int` · VarDecl shape. Mirrors the spec's Overflow example
# (error-model.md); must stay green.

int faulty(int a, int b): a * b

void main():
    int big = 4611686018427387904
    int r = faulty(big, big) catch Fault.Overflow: -1
    print(r)
